The '''[[Highroad Junction]] Playground''' was a [[Playground|playground]] that introduced to Highroad Junction in May 2010. Just like all other playgrounds once you get to the very top you find a chest, and get a prize. To succeed you must use the launch pads to get you to a good height where you will find platforms.
